WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Mira Tan>Thanks for making time. How do invoices work at Northwind today?</v>

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Dana Holt>We invoice when a milestone closes. Strategy, then identity, then the guidelines. Three invoices per project, never one at month end.</v>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Mira Tan>How does Ledgerly handle that?</v>

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:32.000
<v Dana Holt>I copy the last invoice, change the milestone line and send it by hand. It works, but the app thinks in months and we think in projects.</v>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
<v Mira Tan>What would make the biggest difference?</v>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Dana Holt>Knowing next month. Payroll is on the twenty-fifth. In the first week of the month I want to see what cash comes in before then, and from whom.</v>

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
<v Mira Tan>How do you find that out now?</v>

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Dana Holt>I guess. I look at which milestones should close and hope the clients sign them off on time.</v>
